<title>HONG KONG: Jasmine Int'l mandates 7.7 bln yen loan.</title>
<headline>Jasmine Int'l mandates 7.7 bln yen loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai telecommications firm Jasmine International Public Co Ltd has mandated Societe Generale Asia to arrange a 7.7 billion yen loan facility, Societe Generale said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The facility will carry a maturity of five years and the repayment will be in bullet form.</p>
<p>An underwriting group is being formed.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
